cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its figures, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "bb5kbc-visuals: Talk figures for the BB-5KBC Linked Open Data pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Slide-format (7:4) SVG/PNG figures explaining the BB-5KBC archaeological
  Linked Open Data pipeline: Wikidata enrichment, the bb5kbc: application
  ontology, its CIDOC CRM crosswalk, uncertainty modelling, and the
  geo/dating/culture entity patterns. Generated by pure-Python scripts and
  rasterised with resvg-py, no external CLI tools required. Sibling
  repository to crossy-graph/crossy-visuals, same house pattern, own
  palette. Companion to Schmidt & Thiery, "BB-5KBC: Eine reproduzierbare
  Linked Open Data-Strategie fuer archaeologische Fundplatzdaten", Squirrel
  Papers 8(1), 2026, doi:10.5281/zenodo.19830968.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Thiery
    given-names: Florian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3246-3531"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-10"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Research-Squirrel-Engineers/bb5kbc-visuals"
